    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 93,
        "text": "We have a budget of twenty-five pounds for the soup evening. Have you made a list, Ben?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "94d3fc18baee0204829d7fb41eda7ef3259fe753df2b13e8b305f9409f8801c9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 99,
        "sourceEnd": 217,
        "text": "Yes. We need two loaves of bread, one bag of rice, three packets of soup and one liter of juice. Let us take a basket.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7015b792afd1ed288a4b87b1fcd39c1235199d2b5dd88f0c51aab0844ede5a57",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 224,
        "sourceEnd": 246,
        "text": "How much is the bread?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c05aa82a8c5d1f987d39934f8c9d8886bbfcce435616d7a4b06769a7848935e7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 252,
        "sourceEnd": 368,
        "text": "Each loaf has a price of two pounds fifty. Two loaves cost five pounds in total. The rice is six pounds for the bag.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "07ea54cfbbb43fc345be86d5dc774db54e77eb0943cb0b049232d63ae242ebd9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 375,
        "sourceEnd": 503,
        "text": "The label says two kilograms, so we do not need to weigh it. The smaller one-kilogram bag was out of stock. What about the soup?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "233ec1323b5d6e9676babe4ab049459a4c5672f7ba60d8750fac877a99c8aac8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 509,
        "sourceEnd": 609,
        "text": "Each packet costs two pounds. The quantity is three, so that is six pounds. The juice is two pounds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "153d8ef1490921d89969032390c533b6eea07867b4f2be75e6d705602b713071",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 616,
        "sourceEnd": 748,
        "text": "Then our total before the reduction is nineteen pounds. There is a card saying the shop will discount this purchase by three pounds.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3ffe1391d76efeac998ffc5ea13a717fabdde69e5697e8e1525c38bad41a6432",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 754,
        "sourceEnd": 856,
        "text": "That leaves an amount of sixteen pounds to pay. We can afford it and save nine pounds from our budget.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "55959b198c31cd3a5b45b036986eccd64a915bc7bdb728c0204e0b6dfff51503",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 863,
        "sourceEnd": 945,
        "text": "I have a twenty-pound note in cash. Will you check the change and receipt with me?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6cb4b6bd8c32273dfe4255c3bf277d9b9005ed2232f70fe2b11838eaab3c40b6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 951,
        "sourceEnd": 1060,
        "text": "Of course. We should get four pounds back. If the assistant gives us a coin, we will count it with the notes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b4c243d5b06d615a5561c836fc8081ba2e1e83b795cb2c605ade68e6ab7d669f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 1067,
        "sourceEnd": 1106,
        "text": "Shall we take that package of cups too?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "119884dac4f1e723cd4982681ac241657fc954cae02a84606e921ba5a797c5a6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1112,
        "sourceEnd": 1220,
        "text": "No. It is expensive, and the hall already has cups. A cheap extra is still unnecessary if we do not need it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6ab37cc00d82ac21a5e9df830ca3718faf94467d61256c5ce2651b8b1daa92b2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ella",
        "speaker": "Ella",
        "sourceStart": 1227,
        "sourceEnd": 1330,
        "text": "Agreed. In the shop near my old home, prices were shown in dollars. Here the pound sign is easy to see.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "973c20a602ef4f761e37046f4c1c48a01ab7a0e824c7cdf1025dc44350d4c989",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1336,
        "sourceEnd": 1443,
        "text": "Let us join the queue and then take the food to the hall. We can tell the others exactly how much we spend.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a6c7cf7a714ea5fa125b00833151d2feb4932ac740304ae75e208f684dba2779",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.85
      }
    ]
  },
